From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joan Karadimov <joan.karadimov@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:40:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Include windows.h for ZynAddSubFX's window icon

MasterUI sets its window icon with LoadIcon() and GetModuleHandle()
without including windows.h. FLTK 1.3's headers brought it in; FLTK 1.4
keeps the Windows headers out unless FL/platform.H is included, and the
build fails. Include windows.h where the icon code is compiled.

Upstream: not submitted; lmms/zynaddsubfx master has the same code
---
 plugins/zynaddsubfx/zynaddsubfx/src/UI/MasterUI.fl | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plugins/zynaddsubfx/zynaddsubfx/src/UI/MasterUI.fl b/plugins/zynaddsubfx/zynaddsubfx/src/UI/MasterUI.fl
index 254e505..23639c4 100644
--- a/plugins/zynaddsubfx/zynaddsubfx/src/UI/MasterUI.fl
+++ b/plugins/zynaddsubfx/zynaddsubfx/src/UI/MasterUI.fl
@@ -66,6 +66,11 @@ extern NSM_Client *nsm;
 \#endif} {public
 } 
 
+decl {\#ifdef OS_WINDOWS
+\#include <windows.h>
+\#endif} {private local
+} 
+
 decl {\#include "../globals.h"} {public
 } 
 
